    "ev_id": "EV043",
    "variable": "Aperture distinguishability",
    "category": "Geometry",
    "definition": "Whether every aperture on a single specimen can be told apart from every other, by diameter or by the number of concentric rings engraved around it. Distinct from EV004, which records the distribution of diameters, and from EV039, which records whether diameters conform to a standard between objects",
