    "source_type": "Direct observation",
    "discriminatory_power": "Very High",
    "most_relevant_hypotheses": "H013;H014;C-15"
  },
  {
    "ev_id": "EV047",
    "variable": "Authenticity and provenance security",
    "category": "Documentation",
    "definition": "Security of a specimen as an authentic ancient object: whether it has an excavated findspot, a documented collection history, and any metallurgical or technical authentication. Also whether it may be an ANCIENT local imitation of a classic type, as distinct from a modern forgery",
